{"4114280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "And Eyes To See : Escape Room", "steam_appid": 4114280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'And Eyes To See' is a first person 3D point&amp;click puzzle game (escape room). Solve puzzles using your observational skills and a bit of logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the name 'And Eyes To See' suggests, this game is more than the puzzles, the achievements, or even the main story line. There are many layers ... but I'll leave those for you, the Player, to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >first person point&amp;click puzzle game (escape room)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keyboard navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >point&amp;click style mouse interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >every puzzle has a logical solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some hidden object finding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in-game hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in-game achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manual, unlimited game saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >estimated play time : a couple of hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this game is accompanied by an <strong>official walktrough</strong> (Community Hub &gt; Guides) so that you are guaranteed to be able to finish the game. The walkthrough not only gives you the solution to a puzzle, but it also explains the logic behind it !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'And Eyes To See' is a first 